            "text": "<p>Feathers for wings, collars, soft hackles. Beads for weight and a clean head. Shanks when the fly is articulated. Trout: lighter hooks, softer fiber. Steelhead and salt: stronger wire, flash, materials that survive abrasive mouths.</p>"
